# Container Booking & Fulfillment Guide

This guide walks through quoting a container, booking it, and following it from the loading dock to orbit.

{% callout type="info" title="Real-time Webhook Updates" %}
When a booking changes status from `pending` to `confirmed` and `in-transit`, Cosmo Cargo emits a `booking.status_updated` webhook event to your registered endpoint.
{% /callout %}

---

## Fulfillment Steps

{% steps %}
{% step title="1. Request a Quote" %}
Before booking, price the container for your route and delivery speed with `POST /containers/quote`. Quotes include the shield rating and handling surcharges for refrigerated, pressurized and hazmat cargo.
{% /step %}

{% step title="2. Book the Container" %}
Send a `POST /containers/book` request with the container, the route, the delivery speed, who to notify, and how to pay:

{% tabs %}
{% tab name="cURL" %}
```bash
curl -X POST https://api.cosmocargo.space/v2/containers/book \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "container": {
      "type": "standard",
      "stackable": true,
      "dimensions": { "length": 12000, "width": 2400, "height": 2600 },
      "maxWeight": 28000
    },
    "route": { "origin": "EARTH-LEO-1", "destination": "MARS-OLYMPUS" },
    "deliverySpeed": { "type": "standard-orbit", "estimatedDays": 21 },
    "customer": {
      "name": "Ares Mining Co.",
      "contactInfo": { "notifications": [{ "type": "email", "email": "ops@ares.example" }] }
    },
    "payment": {
      "type": "galactic-credits",
      "accountNumber": "GC-000123456789",
      "amount": 48250,
      "currencyCode": "GCR"
    }
  }'
```
{% /tab %}
{% tab name="JavaScript" %}
```javascript
const response = await fetch("https://api.cosmocargo.space/v2/containers/book", {
  method: "POST",
  headers: {
    "Authorization": "Bearer YOUR_TOKEN",
    "Content-Type": "application/json"
  },
  body: JSON.stringify({
    container: {
      type: "standard",
      stackable: true,
      dimensions: { length: 12000, width: 2400, height: 2600 },
      maxWeight: 28000
    },
    route: { origin: "EARTH-LEO-1", destination: "MARS-OLYMPUS" },
    deliverySpeed: { type: "standard-orbit", estimatedDays: 21 },
    customer: {
      name: "Ares Mining Co.",
      contactInfo: { notifications: [{ type: "email", email: "ops@ares.example" }] }
    },
    payment: {
      type: "galactic-credits",
      accountNumber: "GC-000123456789",
      amount: 48250,
      currencyCode: "GCR"
    }
  })
});
const booking = await response.json();
console.log("Booked container:", booking.bookingId);
```
{% /tab %}
{% /tabs %}
{% /step %}

{% step title="3. Loading and Launch" %}
The dock crew seals the container and assigns it a cargo bay. At launch the booking moves to `in-transit`, and `GET /containers/{containerId}` returns its live position.
{% /step %}
{% /steps %}

---

## Interactive Endpoint Preview

Test this endpoint live in the interactive console below:

{% api-operation spec="cargo-containers" path="/containers/book" method="post" /%}

{% callout type="warning" title="Bay Holds" %}
Bookings in `pending` status hold a cargo bay for up to 10 minutes. If payment is not confirmed within that window, the booking expires and the bay is released.
{% /callout %}
